# Cable Simulation in LTspice

Academic project focused on the simulation of a cable/transmission line model using LTspice.

## Overview

- Modeling of a cable using distributed inductance and capacitance sections
- Calculation of characteristic impedance
- Analysis of voltage maxima and minima along the line
- Simulation of open-circuit, matched-load and loaded-line conditions

## Tools

- LTspice
- LaTeX/PDF report

## Repository structure

- `docs/`: project report
- `simulation/ltspice/`: LTspice schematic file

## Files

- `docs/cable-simulation-report.pdf`: technical report
- `simulation/ltspice/cable_simulation.asc`: LTspice circuit simulation

## Topics

- Transmission line modeling
- Characteristic impedance
- Standing waves
- LTspice simulation
